title: Shuffle Leadership
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: shuffle_leadership_timer = 0
on-arrival: week_activities += 1; shuffle_leadership_timer = 8;
card-image: img/placeholder.jpg
go-to: rm_main

Changing the leadership of the party is painful, but perhaps it is necessary to adapt to changing circumstances.

Removing advisors will increase dissent from their faction of the party, while selecting advisors will increase a faction's strength and reduce their dissent.

- @rm_main: Remove advisors
- @add_advisors: Add advisors
- @remove_none: Don't change advisors.
- @easy_discard

@rm_main
title: Remove advisors
tags: ccp_dual_members_advisor, left_advisor, center_advisor, right_advisor
frequency: 1

- #remove_advisor
- @add_advisors: Add advisors

@remove_none
title: Stop changing advisors.
go-to: root
tags: remove_advisor


@remove_tan_pingshan
title: Remove Tan Pingshan
choose-if: tan_pingshan_advisor = 1
on_arrival: tan_pingshan_advisor = 0; ccp_dual_members_dissent += 5; n_advisors -= 1
tags: remove_advisor
go-to: rm_main

@remove_su_zhaozheng
title: Remove Su Zhaozheng
choose-if: su_zhaozheng_advisor = 1
on_arrival: su_zhaozheng_advisor = 0; ccp_dual_members_dissent += 5; n_advisors -= 1
tags: remove_advisor
go-to: rm_main

@add_advisors
title: Add advisors
choose-if: n_advisors < 3
unavailable-subtitle: Maximum of 3 advisors
go-to: advisor_menu

@advisor_menu
title: Add other advisors.
tags: ccp_dual_members_advisor, left_advisor, center_advisor, right_advisor
frequency: 1

- @CCP: Add Communists
- @leftists: Add Leftists
- @centrists: Add Centrists
- @rightists: Add Rightists
- @rm_main: Remove advisors instead.
- @remove_none: Stop changing advisors.

@CCP
view-if: n_advisors < 3

@leftists
view-if: n_advisors < 3

@centrists
view-if: n_advisors < 3

@rightists
view-if: n_advisors < 3
